  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Across Anthropology (2020), published by Leuven University Press, has been cited 3 times. Beyond that, it has been downloaded 10,212 times and is used in teaching.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Across Anthropology by Margareta von Oswald and Jonas Tinius was published by Leuven University Press in 2020. Conceptually, the work connects to Anthropology and Sociology.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">OpenAlex records 3 citations. Citations peaked in 2020 with 1 citing works. Notable citing venues include Performance Research, International Journal of Cultural Policy and Intersections.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">In teaching, it is discussed in 1 recorded lecture. It has been downloaded 10,212 times via OAPEN. It is recorded in 2 library collections. The work was funded by KU Leuven, Humboldt-Universit\u00e4t zu Berlin and CARMAH.</p>",
